            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如 **/.build-cache。模式仅在此工作区内生效；选中模式不代表其内容可重新生成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For example, project/.build-cache/keep/**. Preserving a child blocks its whole parent cleanup target; Shou does not delete around it. Global and workspace protections still apply.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example, project/.build-cache/keep/**. Preserving a child blocks its whole parent cleanup target; Shou does not delete around it. Global and workspace protections still apply."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如 project/.build-cache/keep/**。保留子项会阻止整个父目标的清理，不会绕过它删除其他内容；全局与工作区保护继续生效。"
