    "Verified group containers may be included; unverified shared data, package receipts and external helpers remain protected. Custom locations and other accounts are not searched. Process checks cover the current account. Missing associations are not added to the plan.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verified group containers may be included; unverified shared data, package receipts and external helpers remain protected. Custom locations and other accounts are not searched. Process checks cover the current account. Missing associations are not added to the plan."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已通过系统元数据确认的共享组容器可以纳入；无法确认的共享数据、安装包收据和外部辅助程序仍受保护。不搜索自定义位置或其他账户；进程检查覆盖当前账户。不存在的关联项目不会加入计划。"
          }
        }
