    "macOS links privacy permissions to the signed app. Development builds with temporary signatures may need access enabled again after an update. If the switch is on but access still fails, remove the old Shou entry with −, add this installed copy with +, and reopen Shou.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS links privacy permissions to the signed app. Development builds with temporary signatures may need access enabled again after an update. If the switch is on but access still fails, remove the old Shou entry with −, add this installed copy with +, and reopen Shou."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 将隐私授权与应用签名关联。使用临时签名的开发版本更新后，可能需要重新授权。如果开关已开启但仍无法访问，请用 − 移除旧 Shou，再用 + 添加当前安装版本，并重新打开 Shou。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS regenerates thumbnails and help indexes when needed.": {
      "localizations": {
